  "created": "2024-08-24T04:04:42.254Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to propose the inclusion of the \"2D Sprite\" package by default in all Worlds projects within VRChat. This package is required for configuring 9-sliced sprites, which are a requirement (or at the very least, a strong recommendation) for any well developed UI. Therefore with every Unity project (VRChat or not) that I make, I tend to find myself needing to install this package manually every single time, which would only be a small issue if it applied retroactively, but it doesn't. It becomes a big hindrance when I must install it with every project I make.\n\nAs such, it would be a much needed improvement to the UI design/development workflow specifically, to already have the required tools for this available at our disposal when we need them, instead of needing to install them manually.",
